  {"id": "edit_webview", "group": "edit", "base": "internal/ai/examples/kakeibo.json", "capabilities": ["answer", "proposal"], "note": "#185 質問 → answer。ネイティブ描画と正直に答える(アプリに webView 部品は無い)",
